    },
    {
      "id": "openai-1788708082293-3",
      "provider": "openai",
      "providerName": "OpenAI (GPT)",
      "providerColor": "#059669",
      "date": "2026-09-06",
      "text": "Traffic that increases too quickly can return a 429 error with the slow_down code. Temporary model overload returns a 503 error with the server_is_overloaded code. Both responses may include Retry-After. When the header is present, wait at least as long as it specifies before retrying. If it's missi",
