      "providerName": "Microsoft Copilot",
      "providerColor": "#0078D4",
      "date": "2026-09-06",
      "text": "Edit with Copilot helps you work with Python in Excel by executing Python code for advanced analysis, automation, and data transformation with results outputted directly in your workbook.",
