      "providerName": "Microsoft Copilot",
      "providerColor": "#0078D4",
      "date": "2026-09-06",
      "text": "What changed: You can now use Edit with Copilot to perform advanced data analysis (statistics, simulations, advanced visualizations etc.) with your workbook data. Existing security and execution controls continue to help manage how code runs.",
